# CLAUDE.md (example router — PROJECT level)

> Copy this to `<project>/CLAUDE.md`. Thin router (~10 lines). All project logic lives in `AGENTS.md`.

Claude Code: read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) first. That file is the project dispatcher.

Follow its bootstrap directive (section 0) before any task.

For universal norms, `AGENTS.md` inherits from `.ai-playbook/specs/*` (git submodule).
